  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lasantosr/intelli-shell/zipball/v3.4.8",
  "body": "This patch release fixes a test suite failure on macOS and resolves a shell integration parsing error in Fish.\r\n\r\n### Improvements\r\n\r\n- **macOS Test Suite Compatibility**: Updated `test_default_config` to correctly account for the platform-specific `keyboard_enhancement` default on macOS, ensuring tests pass successfully during Nix Darwin builds and local macOS test runs.\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- **Fish Shell Integration Parsing**: Fixed startup parse and tokenization errors (`Invalid token '\\c$char'`) when sourcing the integration script in Fish.\r\n\r\n### Update Considerations\r\n\r\n- **Fish Shell Users**: If you use Fish shell, please restart your terminal or re-source your configuration to load the updated integration script."
}
